@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama CD 9: GET /api/v1/distributors/:id/coverage-orders (Asignación Territorial Point-in-Polygon)

actor "Planificador" as User
participant "App Web (Planner)" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Distributor Service" as Service
participant "distribution_zones DB" as ZoneDB
participant "Orders & Trucks DB" as OrdersDB

User -> Web: Selecciona Centro de Distribución en la barra superior
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/distributors/501/coverage-orders?channels=MAYORISTA,COBERTURA
Gateway -> Service: getAssignedOrdersForPlanner(distributorId, channels)

Service -> ZoneDB: findActiveZoneByDistributor(distributorId)
ZoneDB --> Service: zone (polygonGeoJson, areaKm2)

alt Centro con polígono delimitado activo
    Service -> OrdersDB: findOrdersInsidePolygon(polygonGeoJson, channels)
    OrdersDB --> Service: insideOrdersList[]
else Centro sin polígono (Fallback Geográfico)
    Service -> OrdersDB: findOrdersByDistributorFallback(distributorId, channels)
    OrdersDB --> Service: insideOrdersList[]
end

Service -> OrdersDB: findAvailableTrucks(distributorId)
OrdersDB --> Service: availableTrucksList[]

Service -> Service: groupOrdersIntoDeliveryPoints(insideOrdersList, availableTrucksList)
note right of Service
  Lógica en Memoria:
  - Agrupa pedidos por 'deliveryPointId' (Gotas/Paradas)
  - Suma peso total (kg) y volumen (m³)
  - Calcula capacidad disponible vs requerida
end note

Service -> Service: buildCoverageOrdersResponse()
Service --> Gateway: coverageOrdersResponse
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK (Puntos de entrega asignados + Polígono + Flota)
Web --> User: Dibuja polígono esmeralda, ancla depósito de origen y filtra puntos en el mapa
@enduml
